---
// The site's definition of dying, in one place so every page words it the same
// way. It matches the rule used when filling in deaths.json. It is set as a
// footnote: small monospace type beside a ruled line.
//
// The site exists so streamers know whether a game needs a death counter, and
// the definition is written with that in mind.
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<p
  class:list={[
    "border-foreground text-muted-foreground border-l-2 pl-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-pretty",
    className,
  ]}
>
  <strong class="text-foreground font-medium tracking-wider uppercase">What counts as dying?</strong
  >{" "}
  Your character being killed: the kind of death a streamer would add to their death counter. Losing
  a round, a match or a puzzle does not count.
</p>
